ntry to it. You have both the @HA and the @DA in dummy, "],["pg",""],["lc","hada"],["hs","nd"],["at","the hand with the long Diamonds, so your chances look good. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["hs","wh"],["nt","\nThe lead of a Heart, however, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["hs","nh"],["at","uses up your Heart entry "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["hs","nd"],["at","before you have an opportunity to establish the Diamonds. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["hc","hj"],["at","Even if you play the @HJ on the first trick, "],["pg",""],["lc","hj"],["pc","hj"],["hc","hk"],["at","East will win the @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","eh"],["at","and return a Heart "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["hc","ha"],["at","to make you play the @HA. "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["pg",""],["hc","da"],["at","This means you will have to be careful to keep the @DA as an entry."],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["hs","nd"],["nt","After winning the @HA, take advantage of being in dummy by leading a Diamond "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["pc","d"],["hc","dq"],["at","toward the @DQ. "],["pg",""],["lc","dq"],["hc","dk"],["at","If East plays the @DK, "],["pg",""],["lc","dk"],["pc","dk"],["hs","sd"],["at","you play a small card. "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hc","dq"],["at","The next time you get the lead, you can play the @DQ, the high card from the short side, "],["pg",""],["lc","dq"],["hc","da"],["at","then over to the @DA and, "],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","when the suit breaks 3-2, "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","ed"],["hs","nd"],["at","take the other two established Diamond tricks."],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["up","3"],["hc","dk"],["nt","\nIf East does not play the @DK, you must be careful. "],["pg",""],["lc","dk"],["pc","d"],["hc","dq"],["at","Play your @DQ which wins the trick. "],["pg",""],["lc","dq"],["pc","dq"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","sd"],["at","Now you must duck to preserve the entry. Play a small Diamond from your hand "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["hs","nd"],["at","and a small Diamond from the dummy, "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["pc","d"],["hs","ed"],["at","giving up a trick. "],["pg",""],["ls","ed"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["at","The Diamonds are now established "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["hc","da"],["at","and you have the @DA as an entry."],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["nt","\nSince you have to lose a Diamond trick, you must hope that the opponents' Hearts are divided 4-4. "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["md","0,h7,,c9"],["hs","wh"],["at","If one of the defenders was dealt five Hearts, "],["pg",""],["hs","eh"],["at","the defense will be able to take four Heart tricks "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["ls","wh"],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","and a Diamond trick upon gaining the lead."],["",""]]}}